  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T12:38:33.531004Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T13:21:28.945156Z",
  "totalBlocks": 72,
  "translatedBlocks": 72,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38bdb33b66185de4",
      "translationZh": "对于每月处理数千份公用事业账单的客户服务团队而言，准确解析和分析复杂的多页文档始终是一项挑战。格式不一致、表格密集以及布局多样，使得快速提取正确信息变得困难。这会导致回复延迟、账单错误和客户不满。随着文档数量增加，这些低效问题不断叠加，使组织无法利用手中已有的数据采取行动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "503986a3c689202a",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 与 Amazon Textract 集成，提供了解决这一问题所需的检索和生成能力。通过将 Amazon Textract 对结构化和非结构化内容的高精度提取能力与 Amazon Bedrock 的生成式 AI 能力相结合，组织可以从手动搜索文档转向以编程方式查询文档。这能够从大规模公用事业账单中挖掘可付诸行动的洞察，并实现更快速、更准确的客户互动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d64332e5f5bf2eb9",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将演示如何与复杂 PDF 和图像格式的公用事业账单进行对话、解析这些账单、分析其内容，并标记相关表格，以帮助大语言模型（LLMs）提取最有用的信息。你可以在 GitHub 上找到本文的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "064a6d3a27c2a156",
      "translationZh": "客户服务支持团队会收到大量有关公用事业账单的咨询，涉及账单、用量、付款和客户服务等多个领域。团队难以高效地解析和分析这些咨询，其格式多种多样，包括 PDF、DOCX、TXT、HTML 和 XLSX。从这些文档中手动提取相关信息的过程既耗时又容易出错，导致响应时间延长和客户不满。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e49faf438dd9fa0f",
      "translationZh": "为解决上述问题，客户最初尝试直接使用公用事业账单实施检索增强生成（RAG）解决方案。然而，他们很快就遇到了严重问题。用于从这些文档中提取信息的大语言模型（LLM）会遗漏关键细节，并且在某些情况下会产生幻觉，提供错误或不相关的信息。这让客户意识到，仅以原始形式加载文档和公用事业账单，无法生成可靠、准确的回复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e503e770ef06d512",
      "translationZh": "客户服务支持团队需要一个稳健的解决方案，以准确提取和分析各种公用事业账单中的信息，这些账单有多种格式：PDF、DOCX、TXT、HTML、PNG 和 XLSX。团队希望构建一个基于 RAG 的解决方案，能够可靠地提取账号、账单详情和付款说明等相关信息，从而准确、及时地回复客户咨询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f604f470da06ba2f",
      "translationZh": "客户最初采用的方法是将原始公用事业账单直接输入 RAG 模型。这种方法存在几个缺点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d3588a139677f32",
      "translationZh": "数据提取不完整：LLM 难以提取所有必要信息，经常遗漏到期日、付款金额和账号等关键细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a24b89fb1bf4c1a",
      "translationZh": "幻觉：模型偶尔会生成错误或不相关的信息，导致客户服务回复出现混淆和错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd8a6113370cb8ba",
      "translationZh": "格式差异：公用事业账单的不同格式（PDF、DOCX、TXT、HTML、XLSX）给 LLM 带来了挑战，导致其在处理不同文档类型时表现不一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cae37544fc82749e",
      "translationZh": "在观察到这些问题后，客户很快意识到需要采用更完善的方法。仅仅将原始文档加载到 RAG 模型中是不够的。团队需要一种方法来预处理和增强公用事业账单，以便 LLM 能够准确提取和使用所需信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78142c7774c1a09b",
      "translationZh": "目前支持以下文件类型：PDF、DOCX、TXT、HTML、XLSX 和 PNG。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af1d90fb6408f6de",
      "translationZh": "PDF（便携式文档格式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b8a9ffc1a572a5b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Textract 可以从多页 PDF 文档中提取文本，包括具有复杂布局和嵌入图像的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b056fbf65cd0fb2c",
      "translationZh": "DOCX（Microsoft Word 文档）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14554d8cf9536470",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Textract 可以解析 Word 文档并从中提取文本，包括表格、图像和其他嵌入对象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87c2b573bf49ac11",
      "translationZh": "TXT（纯文本文件）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d596b0eea1e3bb23",
      "translationZh": "可以通过解析纯文本文件来提取文本内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a709af5ccf6d1122",
      "translationZh": "HTML（超文本标记语言）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e7034fd8c62a95d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Textract 可以从 HTML 文件中提取文本，包括标签内的结构化数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d82cdb0730877887",
      "translationZh": "XLSX（Microsoft Excel 电子表格）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdefc283b84fe80f",
      "translationZh": "虽然 Amazon Textract 主要是一款文本提取工具，但它也可以从 Excel 电子表格中提取文本，包括单元格内容和表格数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd5d45b4235c795f",
      "translationZh": "PNG（便携式网络图形）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c2273c8aca7058c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Textract 可以从 PNG 文件中提取文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd12bc1bd3a9cdae",
      "translationZh": "为应对这些挑战，客户可以选择将文本提取服务 Amazon Textract 与 Amazon Bedrock 集成。此集成提供以下功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41096e35312c5c87",
      "translationZh": "高级文本提取：Amazon Textract 对公用事业账单进行预处理，从各种格式中提取文本，并捕获所有相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a413026cff021133",
      "translationZh": "数据清洗与丰富：对提取的数据进行清洗和丰富，以去除噪声和无关信息，确保只有最相关的细节被输入 RAG 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13e038cd7e0e1782",
      "translationZh": "上下文理解：Amazon Textract 利用上下文理解能力，为提取的数据准确标注并添加标签，使 LLM 更容易处理这些数据并生成准确的回复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0911d2af28c9db01",
      "translationZh": "通过实施这种方法，客户服务团队旨在构建更可靠的基于 RAG 的解决方案。该解决方案能够准确提取和使用公用事业账单中的信息，缩短响应时间并提高客户满意度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b76899e2a361328c",
      "translationZh": "为部署该解决方案，已创建一个 shell 脚本，用于创建 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈，并根据解决方案的需要部署依赖资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "179e0fabeefa31a9",
      "translationZh": "要运行该 shell 脚本，请按照以下步骤操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "842f2fd99bd3fd69",
      "translationZh": "从 GitHub 克隆仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96edc5eabeb33289",
      "translationZh": "进入 custom-knowledge-base 目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29b9f22d2fda3d80",
      "translationZh": "打开终端并运行 bash custom_kb_deployment_setup.sh。这将为你部署 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25b0290a53c1a19",
      "translationZh": "CloudFormation 堆栈会在你的账户中创建以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ddd9bb045c4e7dd0",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda 执行角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "304cc77e62a6ca7d",
      "translationZh": "供 Lambda 函数使用的 Lambda 层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "917889c33f91e82d",
      "translationZh": "一个 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20e7c8216eb79ee1",
      "translationZh": "一个 Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 集群。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1cf75ece499d3323",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 知识库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "697705ab392c7659",
      "translationZh": "用于 Amazon Bedrock 知识库的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0c3c4c7b8346aa28",
      "translationZh": "部署后步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcfdaf2eff892090",
      "translationZh": "堆栈部署完成后，请完成以下步骤以配置该解决方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47477f3384833fa8",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon S3 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4887655d1dcd6c6",
      "translationZh": "找到已创建的名为 document-<stack-name>-<partial-stack-id> 的 S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76d1f50bb0da665f",
      "translationZh": "创建一个名为 raw_files 的文件夹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "125cf119145e320f",
      "translationZh": "将存储库中提供的公用事业账单上传到 raw_files。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8b2394bf9ce9a0a",
      "translationZh": "自动化处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a658c19fb322c707",
      "translationZh": "上传文件会触发 document-parser Lambda 函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "460c2b433116583a",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Textract 作业处理原始文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a52a4eed0e7e85a3",
      "translationZh": "处理后的文件保存到 parsed_files 文件夹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8419d0cd5f482674",
      "translationZh": "第二个 Lambda 函数将这些文件处理为 TXT 格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00338e943821441a",
      "translationZh": "最终输出保存到 parsed_kb_documents 文件夹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cb72181d6b04eccc",
      "translationZh": "知识库设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25764f44a064d3b6",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon Bedrock 控制台，导航至 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases，这是一项用于构建检索增强生成解决方案的全托管功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "879554dfc36a53d4",
      "translationZh": "在左侧导航窗格中，选择 Knowledge Bases。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09b34d689f569c21",
      "translationZh": "选择新创建的知识库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f990d6dfddd0d2c5",
      "translationZh": "选择数据源，然后选择 Sync（同步）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0719748e22d55b28",
      "translationZh": "等待同步完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f968420567873da2",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon Bedrock 控制台并选择该知识库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc9ff5e2492d4df5",
      "translationZh": "选择 Text Knowledge Base（文本知识库）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "602c733252d01c1b",
      "translationZh": "在配置下，选择 Amazon Nova Micro 模型。有关模型在各 AWS Region 的可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的 Supported models by AWS Region（按 AWS Region 列出的受支持模型）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb2c001085c7f895",
      "translationZh": "现在，您可以在右侧的文本框中提出与公用事业账单相关的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f77f1d1f9fcd7590",
      "translationZh": "图 1：使用自定义知识库解决方案的输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c74ad10caf5b3368",
      "translationZh": "图 2：未使用自定义知识库解决方案时的输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a6043eec21b2c42",
      "translationZh": "本指南概述了使用 AWS 服务部署自定义知识库解决方案的流程。该解决方案使用 AWS CloudFormation 自动创建必要的资源，包括 Lambda 函数、S3 存储桶、OpenSearch Serverless 集群和 Amazon Bedrock 知识库。部署过程会运行一个 shell 脚本，启动部署该解决方案所需的 CloudFormation 堆栈创建流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4f15e4a54c4772e",
      "translationZh": "部署后的步骤包括配置 S3 存储桶、上传示例文档，以及设置 Amazon Bedrock 知识库。该解决方案会自动处理上传的文档，将其转换为适合知识库使用的格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "393fb822f01b5155",
      "translationZh": "这个自定义知识库解决方案展示了如何集成多种 AWS 服务，以创建智能文档处理和查询系统。通过使用 CloudFormation 进行部署，该解决方案可以在不同环境中创建一致、可重复的基础设施。从原始文件上传到知识库集成的自动化文档处理流水线，展示了以可扩展、高效的方式处理大型文档集的潜力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "06a2154cdd1ce701",
      "translationZh": "负责任 AI 的考量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8fb304c5f7ac3ac",
      "translationZh": "在生产环境中部署基于 RAG 的解决方案时，实施防护措施以确保输出可靠、可信十分重要。Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 提供可配置的控制措施，用于过滤有害内容、阻止禁止的话题，并对输入和输出中的敏感信息进行遮蔽。此外，依据验证通过评估模型响应是否得到检索到的源文档的支持，帮助检测和减少幻觉。对于生产部署，我们建议开启这些控制措施，以便在与知识库的各类交互中保持准确性、合规性和用户信任。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "414aedb1ec97f753",
      "translationZh": "对于需要处理大量结构化文档的组织，例如本示例中处理公用事业账单的组织，这个解决方案尤其有价值。它提供了一种简化的方式来提取、处理和查询这些文档中的信息，有望提高运营效率，并支持更复杂的数据分析。未来的改进可以包括扩展所处理的文档类型、集成其他 AWS 服务以开展更复杂的分析，或开发一个用户友好的前端界面，以便更轻松地与知识库交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75a6c24f2f09aaee",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，对于希望在 AWS 上构建智能文档处理和查询系统的组织，这个解决方案是一个扎实的起点，同时具备根据具体业务需求进行定制和扩展的灵活性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
